  <para style="h">Udiana Ñwed Tesalonia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Udiana Ñwed Tesalonia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Udiana Ñwed Tesalonia</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Tes</para>
  <para style="mt1">Udiana Ñwed Tesalonia</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ekọọm ye Akam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Ami Pọọl, Sailas<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Greek </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Silfanus</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ado ukem ye </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sailas</char></note> ye Timoti, inọọ ñwed ami esọk ufọkabasi mbon Tesalọnika ke Abasi Ete ñnyịn ye Abọọñ Yisọs Krais. <verse eid="2TH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Mfọn ye emem a-atooho Abasi Ete ye Abọọñ Yisọs Krais akpekap aba ye ndufo.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Akpena ñnyịn isikọọm Abasi afịd ini inọ ndufo, nditọeka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Greek adelfọi awuọñọke </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nditọeka </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ideen ye ibaan </char><char style="ft" closed="false">anyʌñ asʌk ada anọ mme ideen ye ibaan e-enịmme Krais ke akpanikọ ke atu ubon Abasi; se ñko 2 Tesalonia 2:1, 13, 15; 2 Tesalonia 3:1, 6, 13.</char></note> ke Krais, ndin a-anen adinam ntoro, sia mbuọdidem ndufo asʌk anekke akọt, ndin ima a-afịd ndufo enieghe enọ emọ-emọ asʌk atọt. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Ke ntoro, ñnyịn imikpọ inua ke atu mme ufọkabasi ibaña nsịnifịk ye mbuọdidem ndufo ke afịd ndutʌhọ ye idomo a-ndufo eyọọhọ.<verse eid="2TH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Afịd ami ado ntiense ke ubiideikpe Abasi ado adinen, ndin nte ibọọrọ, eyaibat ndufo ke emedot ke abioubọọñ Abasi a-ndufo ebọọhọ ufen ebaña. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Abasi ado adinen, ndin anye ayaakpe utịb mfịna anọ mbon i-inọọhọ ndufo mfịna, <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />ayaanyʌñ ibiommo ndufo ufen e-ebọọhọ, ye ñnyịn ñko. Ami adiitịppe ke emaeyaara Abọọñ Yisọs eto hefịn ke ekamba edeme ikañ ye mme enyere e-enieghe akpọsọñ adudu. <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />Anye ayaamia mbon i-imiidiọọñọke Abasi ufen, i-imiinyʌññọ isuuk iwuod inọ eti etob Abọọñ ñnyịn Yisọs. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Eyaenọ ammọ ufen ye nsi-nsi nsobo enyʌñ ekʌk usʌñ esio ammọ ke iso Abọọñ ye ke ubọọñ adudu amọ <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />ke usen a-anye adiidi idiyaara ubọọñ ke mme ndisana awo; ñko adiido utịppe ñkpọ ñkpaidem ke atu mbon e-enịmme ke akpanikọ. Ndufo ñko esịne ke atu ami, sia ndufo emaenịm ikọ ntiense a-ñnyịn ikitañña inọọ ndufo.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Sia inieghe ami ke esịd, ñnyịn ibọñ akam inọ ndufo afịd ini, ite Abasi ñnyịn akpenam ndufo edot ikood amọ, ndin ato ke adudu amọ anye anam afịd nti uduak ndufo ye afịd adinam a-atooho mbuọdidem ndufo asu. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />Ñnyịn ibọñ akam ami, nọ anyịñ Abọọñ ñnyịn Yisọs akpebọ ubọọñ ke idem ndufo, ndin ndufo ñko ke anye, nọ asaña akekem ke mfọn Abasi ñnyịn ye Abọọñ Yisọs Krais.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Awo Immiinịmme Mbed</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Ke abaña adidi Abọọñ ñnyịn Yisọs Krais ye ñnyịn adiboho keed ye anye, ñnyịn ikpe ndufo ubọk, nditọeka ke Krais ite, <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />ikiisọp iyak ñkpọ itịmede ndufo esịd me adinam ndufo ndịk ato mme usʌk brọfesi, etob me ñwedetob e-ebooho ke ito ñnyịn, a-abooho ke usen Abọọñ adisịm ama. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Ikiiyak awo ndomokeed ibiaña ndufo ke baaba usʌñ ndomokeed, sia usen ado idiidiighe, ibọhọke ndutịme aba ndin enyʌñ eyaara awo abiad mbed, awo e-enịmme enọ nsobo. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Anye ayaabiọọñọ anyʌñ abenne idem amọ akọñ akan afịd se ekoot Abasi me se ekpono, nọ anye aben idem amọ adot ke tembịd Abasi, anyʌñ asian idem amọ anwa-anwa nte Abasi.<verse eid="2TH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Nte ndufo itoiyoke ke mmaasitañ mme ñkpọ ami inọ ndufo idaha ñkebaaha ye ndufo? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Ndin idahami ndufo emediọọñọ se imʌm anye ikama, nọ ato do mme ñkpọ ami eyaara ke akem ini. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Sia ndedịbe adudu ubiad mbed mmọdo ababa idahami, ado andimʌm anye ñkama ayaakaiso anam ntoro tutu eben anye efep. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Ndin eyaeyaara abiadmbed, a-Abọọñ Yisọs adiidooro iduọọk ito ke ibifịk a-awuọhọ anye ke inua, ndin anyʌñ abiat anye ato ke uyamma adidi amọ. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Adidi abiad mbed ayaasaña akekem ye utom Setan. Anye ayaakama mme nsio-nsio adudu abiaña e-esañake ye mme idiọọñọ ye mme ñkpọ ñkpaidem, <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />ye afịd usʌñ abiaña i-ibak akamake ayaañ mbon e-ediitak. Ammọ etak sia ammọ emaesịn adima akpanikọ ñnyʌñ mbọọ adinyaaña. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Ke ntak ami ke Abasi anọ ammọ ekamba abiaña nọ ato do ammọ enịm nsu ami ke akpanikọ, <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />ndin nọ ato do ebiom afịd mbon i-imiinịmme akpanikọ ikpe ado ekop idadesịd ke adinam ibak.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sọọñọ Da</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Ado akpena afịd-afịd ini ñnyịn ikọọm Abasi ke ntak ndufo, mme nditọeka ke Krais A-Abasi amaaha, sia tọọñọ ke aditọọñọ Abasi amaimek ndufo adibọ adinyaaña nto ke utom adinam asana ake Sịbidịd ye ke adinịm ke akpanikọ. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Anye akikoot ndufo anọ ñkpọ ami ato eti etob ñnyịn, nọ ato do ndufo ekan ewuana ke ubọọñ Abọọñ ñnyịn Yisọs Krais.<verse eid="2TH 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Ke ntoro, nditọeka ke Krais, isọọñọ ida inyʌñ imʌm ukpeebñkpọ a-ñnyịn iyakka inọọ ndufo ikama, a-atooho ke ikọ inua me anyʌññọ ato ke ñwedetob.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Yak Abọọñ ñnyịn Yisọs Krais ke idem amọ ye Abasi Ete ñnyịn, a-akimaaha ñnyịn, ndin ke mfọn amọ inọ ñnyịn nsi-nsi nsọọñọidem ye eti idodanyen, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />isọọñọ ndufo esịd anyʌñ inọ ndufo adudu ke afịd nti adinam ye ikọ.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Pọọl Abeeñe Akam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Ke akpatre, nditọeka ke Krais, ibọñ akam inọ ñnyịn nọ etob ikọ Abọọñ asuana usọp-usọp, ñko enyʌñ ekpono anye kpa naña akedo ye ndufo. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Ibọñ akam ñko ibo yak ifak ñnyịn esio ke ubọk ndiọi ye mme mbubịk awo, sia idooho afịd awo enie mbuọdidem. <verse eid="2TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Ado Abọọñ ado anam akpanikọ, ndin anye ayaisọọñọ ndufo idem anyʌñ ifak ndufo asio ke ubọk andidiọọk. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Ñnyịn iminie mbuọdidem ke Abọọñ ke ndufo esʌk enam, ñko ke eyaekaiso enam mme ewʌhọ a-ñnyịn inọọhọ. <verse eid="2TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Yak Abọọñ adat esịd ndufo usʌñ ke ima Abasi ye nsịnifịk ke Krais.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndʌdutọñ A-abañake Ifu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Ke anyịñ Abọọñ Yisọs Krais, ñnyịn inọ ndufo ewʌhọ, nditọeka ke Krais, ite ediañña nsaña ye afịd nditọeka ke Krais e-edoññoke ifu, i-imiinyʌñọ isaña ikikem ke ukpeebñkpọ a-ndufo ekebọọhọ ito ñnyịn. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Sia ndufo ke idem ndufo emediọọñọ naña ndufo ekpenaa ekeene uwọdñkpọ ñnyịn. Ñnyịn ikidooho ifu ini a-ñnyịn ikibaaha ye ndufo, <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />ñnyịn ikinyʌññọ idia ndidia awo ndomokeed a-ñnyịn imiikikpeeghe akʌk. Utu ke ado, ñnyịn imainam utom akonayio ye uweemeayio, itịñ anyen inam akpọsọñ utom mbaak ato do ñnyịn idido mbiomo inọọ awo ndomokeed. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Ñnyịn ikinam ami, idooho nte ñnyịn inieghe unen adibọ utọ unwam ado ito ndufo, ado nọ ñnyịn inịm idem ñnyịn nte uwọdñkpọ a-ndufo ekpekeeneke. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Sia ini a-ñnyịn ikibaaha ye ndufo, ñnyịn imainọ ndufo ewʌhọ ite “Awo i-imiiyemme adinam utom, inaaha adia ñkpọ.”<verse eid="2TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Ñnyịn imikop ke usʌk ke atu ndufo edoñño ifu ye mbon ntịme. Ammọ inamma utom; ammọ edo mme ñkpọ mbeghe, esaaña esịn anyen ke ñkpọ mbon mfen. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Utọ ibon ami ke ñnyịn inọọ ewʌhọ, inyʌñ ikpak ammọ ke Abọọñ Yisọs Krais ite esuuk etie, enam utom nọ ato do ammọ enie ndidia se edia. <verse eid="2TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Ndin ndufo, nditọeka ke Krais, ikiiyak adinam se ifọn ikak ndufo.<verse eid="2TH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Adieke awo ndomokeed mmiikoppo item ñnyịn ke ñwedetob ami, inekke iwuuk anyen ise anye. Ikiinie se ewuana ye anye, nọ ato do abuud anam anye. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Ado ndufo ikiidat ammọ nte mbon usua, ado inọ anye item nte ayịneka ke Krais.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Akpatre Ekọọm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Ndin, yak Abọọñ emem ke idem amọ inọ ndufo emem ke afịd ini ye ke afịd usʌñ. Yak Abọọñ aba ye afịd ndufo.<verse eid="2TH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Ami Pọọl, ñwet ekọọm ami ke ubọk mmi, a-adooho asaña-asaña idiọọñọ ke afịd mme ñwedetob mmi. Ntom ado naña ami ñwet ñkpọ.<verse eid="2TH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Yak mfọn Abọọñ ñnyịn Yisọs Krais aba ye afịd ndufo.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>